49923, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/zaq1ygtps0aeaqyjfver.jpg"}, {"id": 49921, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/drqu1yxmux8kb0wjchpw.jpg"}, {"id": 49922, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/hsmrzcqkgalwtwnwtmtz.jpg"}, {"id": 49925, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/iqr5xqvzsrahpylqmbxv.jpg"}], "slug": "nightshade--2", "storyline": "In an age of constant war, rivaling ninja clans Iga and Kouga effectively expanded their respective forces.\n\nDue to that long history of warring, both clans dwelled in their hatred towards one another. However, during the ninth year of the Tenshou era, the Tenshou Iga war, led by Oda Nobunaga, destroyed the Iga forces, leading the members who survived to be taken in by the Kouga Clan.\n\nSeventeen years later, Sengoku period had ended, lasting peace came back to Japan and the Iga and Kouga clans totally merged together.\n\nDreaming to be a full fledged shinobi and perform in her duties, Ueno Enju (the protagonist), only daughter of Kouga clan's head Ueno Kandou, had been training everyday.\n\nFinally chosen for her first mission, she departs with her ambitions in mind, unknowingly setting her fate in motion : an incident occurs, which could very well be a turning point for Enju's life, and the village's as well...", "summary": "A romance visual novel game made in collaboration with D3P and Red Entertainment.Character design and illustrations are by the popular illustrator Teita. The romance revolves around Ninjas who have lived through the Sengoku Period.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nightshade--2", "videos": [{"id": 77206, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PoPmsKHFH2g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PoPmsKHFH2g", "title": "\u3010\u4e59\u5973\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3011 PS Vita\u300e\u767e\u82b1\u767e\u72fc \uff5e\u622